Eagle Boards
Copyright 2026 David Norman

This product is a native macOS version of the Eagle Board Scheduler, a
board of review check-in and room scheduler for a Scouting district.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ORIGINAL WORK
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Eagle Board Scheduler was reconstructed from a pre-existing application
received only as a compiled JAR. This product carries over that
application's data-file format, board rules and sign-in pages, and is a
derivative of the original author's work.

See PROVENANCE.md.

